### Atlas S10 — the integration surface by hand: webhooks, idempotency, API keys.
### Set @token from a register-org / login response first.

@base = http://localhost:5080/api/v1
@token = PASTE_A_SESSION_TOKEN

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Webhooks
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Register a webhook (all events). The response reveals the signing secret ONCE — store it.
POST {{base}}/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://partner.example/atlas-hooks",
  "events": []
}

### List subscriptions (no secret is ever returned here).
GET {{base}}/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The delivery log — narrow to one subscription to watch its attempts and backoff.
GET {{base}}/webhooks/deliveries?subscriptionId=PASTE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Redeliver a failed delivery (re-signs and re-sends the ORIGINAL payload).
POST {{base}}/webhooks/deliveries/PASTE_DELIVERY_ID/redeliver
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pause a subscription (idempotent).
DELETE {{base}}/webhooks/PASTE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Verifying a signature (pseudocode a partner runs):
###   header  = X-Atlas-Signature: t=1737000000,v1=<hex>
###   signed  = "{t}.{raw_body}"
###   expect  = hmac_sha256(secret, signed)  (hex, lowercase)
###   accept iff constant_time_equals(expect, v1) AND abs(now - t) <= tolerance

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Idempotency — money-moving POSTs REQUIRE Idempotency-Key
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Pay an approved invoice. Retrying with the SAME key replays this response (no second charge).
POST {{base}}/invoices/PASTE_INVOICE_ID/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 5f3c9e1a-pay-attempt-1

### The retry — identical request + key → 200 with header `Idempotency-Replayed: true`.
POST {{base}}/invoices/PASTE_INVOICE_ID/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 5f3c9e1a-pay-attempt-1

### Missing key on a money-moving POST → 400.
POST {{base}}/invoices/PASTE_INVOICE_ID/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Same key, DIFFERENT request → 422 idempotency-conflict.
POST {{base}}/invoices/A_DIFFERENT_INVOICE_ID/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 5f3c9e1a-pay-attempt-1

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Partner API keys — scoped, hashed at rest, revealed once
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Mint a scoped key. The `key` in the response is shown ONCE.
POST {{base}}/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Partner dashboard (read-only)",
  "scopes": ["read:workers", "read:invoices"]
}

### Use the key as a bearer credential. read:webhooks is required for this call → 403 with the key above.
GET {{base}}/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer atk_PASTE_THE_ONE_TIME_KEY

### List keys (display prefix only — never the raw key or its hash).
GET {{base}}/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revoke a key — the next request presenting it is 401.
DELETE {{base}}/api-keys/PASTE_API_KEY_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
